ui_rules:
PINNED HEADER on every screen:
- left: a two-line hamburger that opens the full-height index;
- centre-left: Westside's own wordmark, as supplied vector;
- right, text-only labels: SEARCH (a jump-to-screen field styled as an underlined input), CONTACT, and PILOT [n], which counts the properties added to the pilot.

