research.summary:
Zara runs a small set of named, recurring formats. Each one appears on the same day across its own surfaces: the Instagram grid, the app and web home page, store windows and, for tentpoles, one physical room. The brand account stays quiet and magazine-like: about 61.6-62.3M Instagram followers; about 14.7M TikTok followers in Feb 2026 and about 15M in Aug 2026, the most-followed fashion brand on TikTok. A creator layer Zara does not author carries the try-on and haul volume: about 101.6K Zara-related TikTok posts in six months (vendor data). Zara also led Europe's Q4 2025 earned-media ranking at about EUR 87.8M (Kolsquare).

From 2024 to 2026 Zara added five things:
- its own broadcast surface, Zara Streaming: four Western episodes, 25 Sep 2024 to 11 Dec 2025, ending as a roughly 15-minute film, Le Dîner;
- an influencer-written editorial section inside the shop, The Fold-er, 12 Jun 2026;
- an AI utility, Try-On: mid-Dec 2025, app only, 43 markets and more than 7M sessions by 11 Mar 2026;
- designer and auteur tentpoles, each with one curated room: Paris 50th pop-up Oct 2025, Galliano Re{form} Vol. 1 on 1 Oct 2026, Guadagnino/Baisi at La Pelota Sep 2026;
- stores built as sets: the Nanjing "fit check" studio, 21 Mar 2025, bookable through WeChat.

The change on creators is that Zara brings them inside its own art direction (Evan Ross Katz on Streaming, The Fold-er columnists, Bad Bunny dressed for the Super Bowl) instead of buying ambassador posts. Separate accounts split audiences: @zaraman (since Mar 2019, about 2M), @zarahome (about 8.1M), @zarakids (about 2.6M).

Zara India has no India-specific account I could find. Its only local creative moment was the Reverie Diwali capsule with Jayesh Sachdev on 15 Oct 2024, with a 10-ft tiger sculpture at Phoenix Palladium. I found no India festive or wedding campaign in 2025 or 2026, which leaves that calendar open for Westside.

Caveats:
- Every direct page fetch was blocked by the proxy, so I could not inspect the @zara grid. Caption, tagging and Reel conventions rest on weak single sources.
- The 200-search cap was reached before the last checks (US menswear store, @LivingZara).

